0QeuB1MuibhAZA62Xg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/GP52QZUPMqdvH1KjT7esiaIdQaOzq5iayTia4P5tr4TgP3uHWEkG1BjVZRB7pr5Y6I115BaS0QeuB1MuibhAZA62Xg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>八、其他说明</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>1</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学生所申报的各种信息和申请资料必须真实，如有弄虚作假，一经查实，申请人的考核成绩无效，取消申请人所获得的资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>2</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>考生可以到动物科技学院官网（http://dkdy.sdau.edu.cn/）了解更多学院和导师信息。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>3</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><sectio